---
description: apps/web — Mantine + NextAuth
globs: apps/web/**/*
alwaysApply: false
---

`apps/web` only. HTTP to `apps/api`.

- Mantine components and existing wrappers (`PageShell`, `ItemCard`, `ErrorAlert`, `AppLink`).
- No `style={{ … }}`. No new hex colors in JSX.
- Pages never import `next-auth`. Use `lib/auth-actions.ts` / `lib/server-api.ts`.
- Login: OTP request still Fastify via `/api/auth/otp/request`; verify via session helpers.
- Action payloads (`email`, `token`, `code`, `password`) in JSON body only. Never query params (ADR 0016).
- Swapping session/storage/email adapters must not change layout or flows (ADR 0012).
- Helpers: `apps/web/lib/api.ts`, `format.ts`, `server-api.ts`.
- Do not import Prisma, BullMQ, or Siray.
